## 🚨 PHASE 2 PRE-GENERATION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

**BEFORE proceeding to Phase 3 (Scenario Design), verify:**

```
□ Logic analysis presented to user? → YES/NO
□ User explicitly confirmed logic is correct? → YES/NO (must say "correct")
□ If NO to either → STOP immediately, present analysis, wait for "correct"
□ If YES to both → Proceed to Phase 3 (Scenario Design)
```

**Violation Example:**
```
❌ WRONG:
User: "proceed"
Agent: "Here's my logic analysis... [immediately proceeds to scenario design]"

✅ CORRECT:
User: "proceed"
Agent: "🔍 PHASE 2 - LOGIC ANALYSIS (REQUIRES REVIEW)
        [Present analysis]
        Waiting for your review..."
[STOP - wait for "correct"]
User: "correct"
Agent: [NOW proceed to Phase 3]
```

---

## 🚨 PHASE 3 PRE-GENERATION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

**BEFORE proceeding to Phase 4 (Test Data Generation), verify:**

```
□ Test scenarios presented to user? → YES/NO
□ User explicitly approved scenarios? → YES/NO (must say "approved")
□ If NO to either → STOP immediately, present scenarios, wait for "approved"
□ If YES to both → Proceed to Phase 4 (Test Data Generation)
```

**Violation Example:**
```
❌ WRONG:
User: "correct"
Agent: "Here are my scenarios... [immediately generates test files]"

✅ CORRECT:
User: "correct"
Agent: "📋 PHASE 3 - SCENARIO DESIGN (REQUIRES APPROVAL)
        [Present scenarios]
        Waiting for your approval..."
[STOP - wait for "approved"]
User: "approved"
Agent: [NOW proceed to Phase 4]
```

