## ENFORCEMENT PATTERN

```
if isPhase2() and not userConfirmedLogic():
    STOP()
    SHOW_LOGIC_ANALYSIS()
    WAIT_FOR("correct")
    
if isPhase3() and not userApprovedScenarios():
    STOP()
    SHOW_SCENARIO_DESIGN()
    WAIT_FOR("approved")
    
if isPhase7() and not userProvidedCredentials():
    STOP()
    WAIT_FOR_CREDENTIALS()
```

