## QUICK REFERENCE

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| User "Proceed" from Phase 1 | START Phase 2, present logic analysis, STOP for "correct" |
| Phase 2 logic analysis | Present → "Waiting for your review..." → STOP |
| User says "correct" | Proceed to Phase 3 (Scenario Design) |
| Phase 3 scenarios | Present → "Waiting for your approval..." → STOP |
| User says "approved" | Proceed to Phase 4 (Test Data Generation) |
| User says "fix: X" | Update logic understanding, present again, STOP |
| User says "add: X" | Add scenario, present updated list, STOP |
| Asked question / Presented options | STOP and WAIT |
| Missing info | STOP and ASK |
| Phase complete | STOP and REQUEST REVIEW (show what was completed) |
| Thinking "since proceed..." | STOP - Phase transition ≠ decision approval |
| About to create analysis file | **DON'T!** Display in conversation instead |
| Phase 0-3 output | **ALWAYS** in conversation, never files |

